; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) records.
; Publish ServiceMode SVCB/HTTPS records under _agents.<domain> and sign the
; zone with DNSSEC so validating resolvers return authenticated answers.
; Spec: draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid, RFC 9460 (SVCB/HTTPS).

$ORIGIN example.com.
$TTL 3600

; General discovery index endpoint.
_index._agents   IN SVCB 1 discovery.example.com. ( alpn="h2,h3"
                                                     port=443
                                                     endpoint="/.well-known/api-catalog" )

; Agent-to-agent (A2A) endpoint.
_a2a._agents     IN SVCB 1 a2a.example.com.        ( alpn="h2"
                                                     port=443
                                                     endpoint="/a2a" )

; MCP transport endpoint.
_mcp._agents     IN SVCB 1 mcp.example.com.        ( alpn="h2"
                                                     port=443
                                                     endpoint="/mcp" )

; After editing the zone:
;   1. Re-sign:   dnssec-signzone -S -K keys -o example.com db.example.com
;   2. Publish the signed zone and bump the SOA serial.
;   3. Verify:    dig +dnssec _index._agents.example.com SVCB   (expect the 'ad' flag)
